{
  "title": "Por qué tu perro pone cara de culpable — Pépito Saucisse",
  "emph": ["culpable", "Pépito", "Saucisse", "cojín", "plumas", "perdón", "ciencia", "2009",
           "experimento", "galleta", "verdad", "resultado?", "regañaba,", "remordimiento.",
           "calma:", "tranquilizarte.", "tres", "horas.", "cojines.", "comentarios."],
  "beats": [
    {"text": "Si tu perro pone cara de culpable después de una travesura,",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "dog", "props": ["feathers"]},
    {"text": "no es para nada porque se sienta culpable.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "wide", "props": ["feathers", "no_sorry"]},
    {"text": "Este es Pépito Saucisse.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "proud", "camera": "medium", "props": ["name_tag"]},
    {"text": "Ayer, su dueña lo dejó solo en casa… con un cojín nuevo.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "proud", "camera": "wide", "props": [{"name": "cushion", "at": "cojín"}]},
    {"text": "Cuando ella vuelve, hay plumas por todas partes.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "sideeye", "camera": "wide", "props": [{"name": "feathers", "at": "plumas"}]},
    {"text": "Y Pépito baja la cabeza, aparta la mirada y esconde la cola.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "dog", "props": ["feathers"]},
    {"text": "Parece que está pidiendo perdón.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "owner", "props": ["feathers", "owner_angry"]},
    {"text": "Pero la ciencia dice otra cosa.",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "normal", "camera": "wide", "props": [{"name": "lightbulb", "at": "ciencia"}]},
    {"text": "En 2009, la investigadora Alexandra Horowitz hizo un experimento.",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "normal", "camera": "board", "props": [{"name": "magnifier", "at": "investigadora"}]},
    {"text": "Los dueños le prohibían a su perro comerse una galleta y salían de la sala.",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "normal", "camera": "wide", "props": [{"name": "cookie", "at": "galleta"}]},
    {"text": "Al volver, a veces les decían que el perro se la había comido…",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "sideeye", "camera": "dog", "props": ["cookie", "question"]},
    {"text": "aunque no fuera verdad.",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "proud", "camera": "wide", "props": ["cookie"]},
    {"text": "¿Y el resultado?",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "normal", "camera": "dog", "props": ["cookie", "question"]},
    {"text": "Los perros ponían cara de culpable cuando su dueño los regañaba,",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "wide", "props": [{"name": "owner_angry", "at": "regañaba"}]},
    {"text": "hubieran hecho algo o no.",
     "setting": "lab", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "owner", "props": ["owner_angry", "cookie"]},
    {"text": "O sea, esa mirada no es remordimiento.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "wide", "props": ["no_sorry"]},
    {"text": "Es una señal de calma:",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "sideeye", "camera": "medium", "props": ["white_flag"]},
    {"text": "tu perro ve tu cara de enfado e intenta tranquilizarte.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "owner", "props": ["white_flag", "owner_angry"]},
    {"text": "Además, un perro no relaciona tu enfado con algo que hizo hace tres horas.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "sideeye", "camera": "wide", "props": [{"name": "clock", "at": "tres"}]},
    {"text": "Para él, lo único que pasa es que estás de mal humor.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "guilty", "camera": "dog", "props": ["owner_angry"]},
    {"text": "Así que la próxima vez, en lugar de regañarlo, recoge las plumas…",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "proud", "camera": "wide", "props": [{"name": "feathers", "at": "plumas"}]},
    {"text": "y esconde mejor los cojines.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "proud", "camera": "medium", "props": ["cushion", "hearts"]},
    {"text": "Y tu perro, ¿también pone esa carita?",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "sideeye", "camera": "dog", "props": ["question"]},
    {"text": "Cuéntamelo en los comentarios.",
     "setting": "salon", "pose": "proud", "camera": "wide", "props": ["comment", "hearts"]}
  ]
}
